    "description": "BlendJet 2\nPortable Blender, Geode Swirl Pattern\nCordless and Water-Resistant\nThe BlendJet 2 is a versatile portable blender that offers the freedom to create smoothies, protein shakes, and mixed drinks while on the go. Known for its compact footprint and powerful motor, this \"Next-Gen\" blender is designed for convenience without sacrificing performance. This specific unit features a vibrant pastel marble or \"geode\" swirl pattern, making it a stylish addition to a fitness or travel kit.\nUSB-C rechargeable base with a water-resistant design and quiet operation\nBPA-free blending jar featuring ounce and milliliter measurement markings\nIntegrated carrying strap and leak-proof lid for easy transport\nIncludes a black insulated zippered sleeve and the original retail packaging\nCondition:\nThe blender base is cosmetically clean with the swirl pattern fully intact. The blending jar is present and shows light interior residue from use. The lid and carrying strap are securely attached. The black insulated case is clean with a functional zipper. The original box shows minor shelf wear and a small tear on the top opening flap. Charging cable is not included. Sold as-is - functionality not confirmed.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
